    {
      "id": "sticky-overview",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -400,
        -500
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 820,
        "height": 240,
        "content": "## CareerCompass AI\n\nScrapes the monthly HN 'Who is Hiring' thread, uses GPT-5.6 Sol to extract structured job data, scores every job against your profile, logs strong matches (>= 75) to Google Sheets, and emails you a daily digest with cover letter drafts.\n\nNo auto-apply: you review the drafts and apply manually."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "sticky-setup",
      "name": "Sticky Note1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -400,
        -500
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 760,
        "height": 240,
        "content": "## Setup\n\n1. Set instance env vars: JOBHUNT_SHEET_ID (Google Sheet ID) and JOBHUNT_EMAIL_TO.\n2. Connect OpenAI, Google Sheets and Gmail credentials.\n3. Edit the Candidate Profile node with your real profile.\n4. Create a sheet tab named 'Job Matches' with headers: Date, Company, Role, Location, Work Mode, Salary, Match Score, Match Reasons, Missing Skills, Email Subject, Cover Letter, Apply URL, Company URL, HN Item ID, Status.\n5. Activate the workflow."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
